Autodesk Navisworks .NET API
----------------------------
CamelWorks compiles against the Navisworks API reference assemblies and does not
redistribute them. They are supplied by the user's own licensed Navisworks
installation. No Autodesk assembly is included in this repository or in the
CamelWorks bundle.
